BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Evita
DTSTART:20270228T010000Z
DTEND:20270228T032500Z
DTSTAMP:20261018T075020Z
UID:1007290
DESCRIPTION:<p>Reimagined by the visionary Tony Award&reg\;-winning direct
 or Jamie Lloyd\, Tim Rice and Andrew Lloyd Webber&rsquo\;s legendary <em>E
 vita</em> returns to Broadway\, starring Rachel Zegler\, who won the Olivi
 er Award for her acclaimed portrayal of Eva Per&oacute\;n in the West End.
 &nbsp\;<em><br /><br />Evita</em> features an iconic score\, including &ld
 quo\;Don&rsquo\;t Cry For Me Argentina\,&rdquo\; &ldquo\;Oh What a Circus\
 ,&rdquo\; &ldquo\;Another Suitcase in Another Hall\,&rdquo\; and the Oscar
 &reg\;-winning &ldquo\;You Must Love Me.&rdquo\; Fueled by ambition and pa
 ssion Eva Per&oacute\;n rose from poverty to become the most powerful woma
 n in Latin America. A symbol of hope for many Argentines\, her star shone 
 brightly as she captured the nation&rsquo\;s heart and divided its soul.</
 p>
LOCATION:Winter Garden Theatre\, 1634 Broadway\, New York NY 10019
END:VEVENT
